{"metas":[{"id":"tmdb:324707","type":"series","name":"Patrocínio","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//r1DZd5rka497nbkN0kVJlVu2bdE.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/hiRvZNcIsaKW95BWJ3kzX8LXmrM.jpg","description":"In a world dominated by filters and controlled narratives, \"Patrocinio\" breaks with the formality of one of Portugal's most influential families to offer an intimate and unprecedented access to the sisters' world. The camera ceases to be a guest at gala events and instead portrays the emotional, professional, and familial structure that sustains an empire of influence, work, and sisterhood.","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tt44871098","type":"series","name":"7 vs. Wild: Wildcard Competition","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//fEUPkDKEAPMXUv9MmaFG7rcj3BW.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/ljPwmcohnPhn0VOEeI41J4jrw2b.jpg","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt44871098/img","description":"","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tt42207572","type":"series","name":"L'Affaire Céline Giboire - une contre-enquête de McSkyz","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//ibvf49RExx4dC6HdZmX8554ObIw.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/4fbAiQcmzqGpqXaOMVgmFPt20hf.jpg","description":"On February 28, 2012, the body of 16-year-old Céline Giboire was found at the foot of a cliff in the Corbières park in Saint-Malo. Since then, her family has rejected the suicide theory put forward by the authorities and has fought to uncover the truth about the circumstances of her death. McSkyz revisits the case in an attempt to understand what happened to Céline.","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tt39221314","type":"series","name":"The 50","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//tqmEZksj5AMYphDzr0WDCF7Z7I3.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/54W3B9UEn68Oc9cnTsEw3fyyCkD.jpg","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt39221314/img","description":"Tension and strategy, clashes and provocations, but also fun, relationships and friendships, are the ingredients of The 50, the new reality game in which 50 of the most popular Italian celebrities and influencers will compete in a series of tests.","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tt50760081","type":"series","name":"Beating the Odds","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//9jodzeEKpKeh8UvINi6INmcgfAu.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/2KKbAtzJBR23rn8bcEiZ4NIIr9f.jpg","description":"BEATing The Odds: BEAT is charting a new course. After a winless streak, the team has decided to make a change. With a new structure and renewed ambition, the quest for improvement begins. But in a sport where every detail matters, the question is: is this enough to truly break through?","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tt43616085","type":"series","name":"Offline med Isa & Tilda","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//zZ8c3wmFT7tmt2RH8HZETlAkxeH.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//zZ8c3wmFT7tmt2RH8HZETlAkxeH.jpg","description":"In the first season of OFFLINE, Isa and Tilda leave the big city, screens and likes. Stureplan is exchanged for a farm, TikTok for tractors and high heels for rubber boots. No mobile, no champagne, no shopping - just cows, chaos and total shock. Laughter, tears, anger and frustration. Patience and friendship are put to the test. It's iconic, crazy and unforgettable. A season you don't want to miss!","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tt38856253","type":"series","name":"EXAM","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//9jt62J8sfq8pFFovZhEQmxjUqhb.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/w8jWzyz0NiaHPhdrw9ALm1wB3e1.jpg","description":"A determined young woman with a mysterious past enters the dangerous world of the Regional Public Service Exam (RPSE) scam to expose a powerful paper-leak network. But as she digs deeper, she uncovers a corruption chain embedded deep within the education system-and must bring it down before it destroys the dreams of an entire generation.","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tt33546863","type":"series","name":"Off Campus","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//tcPc5ZMBO4y2BtCJMe3o2nwZb2B.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/3ANXZWhhcqPAh0q6nRZ979TIwxC.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/vSCRiiYfTjrIcdyJhb8xyLE3Tdf.png","description":"Hannah Wells tutors hockey captain Garrett Graham to win over her crush. Their deal becomes real connection as they face their pasts. Friends Logan, Dean, Tucker, and Allie navigate college life and love.","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tt40859434","type":"series","name":"Lukkhe","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w600_and_h900_bestv2//w8GLkht5ceCi7KQ3AMD77mzkxBc.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/3P7EX9P0hYZjb92qCnamAbKXKpi.jpg","logo":"https://images.metahub.space/logo/medium/tt40859434/img","description":"A young sportsman infiltrates the wild and dangerous world of Punjab's rap music to investigate a drug syndicate, only to find himself torn between love, family, guilt and brotherhood.","releaseInfo":"2026"},{"id":"tt33270224","type":"series","name":"Cupertino","poster":"https://resizing.flixster.com/-XZAfHZM39UwaGJIFWKAE8fS0ak=/v3/t/assets/p32898304_b_v12_aa.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/f9BMWxAWzFqXtqayrAyNbDFg9cK.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/rWpDBJIePBvmMD2GQk0BHRw8xgr.png","description":"Tomatometer 100%"},{"id":"tt33246591","type":"series","name":"The Assassin","poster":"https://resizing.flixster.com/OGWa5oP41XeR1OBA3QGc50n0mHw=/ems.cHJkLWVtcy1hc3NldHMvdHZzZXJpZXMvNjA1NDU1YzgtOGI1Ni00NjliLWFiY2MtZGRlYzZkMjkyNDJkLmpwZw==","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w1280/7EB84rTBUmjY2tPhNpGjxnKJVeo.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/ptMbRJPQ1dlpNEGIJyGGqUoGWZF.png","description":"Tomatometer 72%"},{"id":"tt15499118","type":"series","name":"The Madame Blanc My